# Story page: easy
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = The Garden
---
The garden is the sort of place where nothing terrible happens, and I urge you to enjoy it, because that sort of place never lasts, and this one is no exception.

{name} ate an apple, and then another, and then a third, and so discovered its purpose in life, which was lunch.

Beyond the hedge something was waiting with enormous patience. It was a wall. Walls are the most patient things in the world, which is precisely what makes them dangerous.
